<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMR Corp upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMR Corp upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Kevin Murphy upgraded his rating on AMR Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details on the move were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Wednesday the parent of American Airlines posted first quarter earnings that topped Wall Street expectations.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not immediately open after closing Wednesday at 85.</p>
</text>
